# Purpose: Refresh the cjxl_parity ledger after a 9-chunk session
# (W44-54 .. W44-63) to:
#   (1) Verify no OPEN→FIXED reverts or quality regressions from the
#       cumulative changes.
#   (2) Attribute byte deltas across the 9 commits (chunk-level).
#   (3) Cluster remaining OPEN cells for W44-65 planning.

