# Post-state (W44-64 @ 6169ba7b): 20 OPEN, 575 FIXED (of 595)
#
# Net OPEN flips this session (W44-56 → W44-64): 0 (set identical).
# Quality regressions: 0 cells with |bfly_delta| > 1 % or |ssim2_delta| > 0.5.
